----

= Trust Recommendations =

You DPS — Hasso / Meditate / Third Eye / Seigan / Sekkanoki / Meikyo Shisui. Trusts with Hasso/Meditate are wasted. Need: Tank, healer, attack buffs.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Rahal">Rahal</a></strong></td><td>Tank w/ Shield Bash interrupt, Enlight, Phalanx — **only tank that casts Berserk on YOU**</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Haste on melee (you), full status removal, Convert</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal directly boost your melee DPS and Acc</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Arciela_II">Arciela II</a></strong></td><td>Slow/Paralyze/Dispel + weakness-targeted nukes</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>💃 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Uka_Totlihn">Uka Totlihn</a></strong></td><td>Quickstep debuff, Violent Flourish interrupts, Drain Samba</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

