= 🥷 Subjob Notes =

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:120px;">Subjob</th><th>Best for</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>/WAR</strong></td><td>EXP, merits, Nyzul, most polearm DD</td><td>Old staple — Berserk/Aggressor/Provoke. **Polearm + /WAR + Penta Thrust** is the standard 5-hit build. No SJ-specific gear</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>/DRG</strong></td><td>Endgame GK with Wyvern</td><td>Main GK sub at 75 — Wyvern healing covers MP-less SAM. **SJ gear: Wyvern Earring**</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>/NIN</strong></td><td>Endgame AoE absorbs</td><td>**Overused**. Useful for nasty AoE NMs only. Avoid in EXP/merit/Nyzul/Puk ISNM</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>/THF</strong></td><td>Niche endgame fights</td><td>Mostly obsolete. SA/TA piggyback for opener WS</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>/DNC</strong></td><td>Solo / Campaign</td><td>**SJ gear: Soboro** (TP for waltzes), VIT gear for Curing Waltz</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>/RNG</strong></td><td>Obsolete (replaced by /WAR Penta build)</td><td>Soboro + Sidewinder spam. **SJ gear: Soboro, Shigeto Bow**, R.Acc/R.Att gear</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

