= ⚔️ Weapons =

== Great Katana ==

(% class="legend-box" %)
**TP gain matters more than DMG/DPS**. Some HQs are *worse* than NQs because they slow your TP build. The Rajas vs non-Rajas split disappears around 70 — by then you should own Rajas.

