(% class="legend-box" %)
**Weaponskill picks:** **Tachi: Yukikaze** (Yuki — added effect) · **Tachi: Kasha** (added effect + makes Light) · **Tachi: Gekko** (highest Att bonus, the standard YGK go-to) · **Tachi: Rana** (no Att bonus — only when Att >> Def) · **Tachi: Kaiten** (Amano-only, beats YGK in most cases — 3.0 fTP at 100 TP).

