----

= 📋 Endgame Set Cheat-Sheet =

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Build for a 5-hit or 6-hit.** With Hagun (TP Bonus) you want to land WS at 200% TP for the +33% damage; with Amano (Kaiten) you can WS at any TP. Saotome +1 set + Brutal Earring + Rajas Ring + Soboro is the classic Store TP backbone.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:140px;">Set</th><th>Pieces</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>TP Build (Store TP focus, 5/6-hit)</strong></td><td>Walahra Turban · **Saotome Domaru +1** · Dusk Gloves / Saotome Kote +1 · Byakko's Haidate · Aurum Sabatons · Saotome Kabuto +1 · Speed Belt · Cerberus Mantle +1 · Peacock Charm · Rajas Ring · Sniper's Ring · Brutal Earring · Assault Earring · Hagun / Amanomurakumo · Fire Bomblet</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Tachi: Gekko / Yukikaze WS</strong></td><td>Hecatomb Cap / Maat's Cap · Kirin's Osode · Hecatomb Mittens · Hecatomb Subligar · Hecatomb Leggings · Snow Gorget (Gekko) / Soil Gorget (Yuki) · Warwolf Belt · Cerberus Mantle +1 · Strigoi Ring · Mars's Ring · Brutal Earring · Bushinomimi</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Tachi: Kasha</strong></td><td>Same as above, swap **Flame Gorget**</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Tachi: Kaiten (Amano-only)</strong></td><td>Same WS set — Kaiten's 3.0 fTP at 100 TP outperforms YGK without needing Att gorget</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Penta Thrust (SAM/WAR Polearm)</strong></td><td>Hecatomb Cap · Kirin's Osode · Hecatomb Mittens · Hecatomb Subligar · Hecatomb Leggings · Soil Gorget · Warwolf Belt · Cerberus Mantle +1 · Iota Ring · Flame Ring · Brutal Earring · Aesir Ear Pendant · Thalassocrat / Gae Bolg</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Meditate Macro</strong></td><td>Saotome Kote +1 (full set bonus enhances Meditate)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Zanshin Macro</strong></td><td>Saotome Kabuto +1 (Zanshin enhance) — AA, IT, etc. fights where Att is high</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}
